WEBVTT

00:00.025 --> 00:02.956
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

00:03.025 --> 00:09.715
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:12.887 --> 00:14.059
Hey, can we get another
嘿，我们可以再买一个吗

00:14.128 --> 00:16.680
Triple Gooberberry Sunrise
over here?
三重 Goobberry 日出
在这里？

00:16.749 --> 00:19.749
And don't you skimp
on the triple.
你不要吝啬
在三重上。

00:19.818 --> 00:20.715
Here's your sun...
这里是你的太阳...

00:20.784 --> 00:22.335
It's starting!
开始了！

00:23.301 --> 00:25.646
[laughs]
[笑]

00:25.715 --> 00:27.128
I'll take another one.
我再拿一张。

00:27.197 --> 00:29.715
This time with less manager.
这次经理较少。

00:29.784 --> 00:32.301
Attention, children of all ages.
所有年龄段的孩子请注意。

00:32.370 --> 00:34.163
- Hello, hi!
- Hey, that's me!
- 你好，你好！
- 嘿，这就是我！

00:34.232 --> 00:36.059
- I love you, I love you!
- All ages, yay!
- 我爱你，我爱你！
- 所有年龄段，耶！

00:36.128 --> 00:39.646
Put your fins together for
the cool cat on the drum kit,
将你的鳍放在一起
架子鼓上的酷猫，

00:39.715 --> 00:42.266
Bongos Bear!
邦戈熊！

00:42.335 --> 00:46.163
On trumpet, this bivalve
really swings.
在喇叭上，这种双壳类
真的很摇摆。

00:46.232 --> 00:48.404
Clem Clam!
克莱姆 克莱姆！

00:48.473 --> 00:50.404
You know him, you love him.
你认识他，你爱他。

00:50.473 --> 00:53.370
Eight tentacles on 88 keys,
88个键上的8个触手，

00:53.439 --> 00:56.680
it's Rock T. Puss.
我是洛克·T·普斯。

00:56.749 --> 00:58.197
That's our combo.
这就是我们的组合。

00:58.266 --> 01:02.232
Give it up
for the Goofy Scoopers!
放弃吧
为了高飞独家！

01:02.301 --> 01:04.473
♪ A one and two and three
and four ♪
♪ 一、二、三
和四个♪

01:04.542 --> 01:06.335
♪ I need more scoops,
ice cream galore ♪
♪ 我需要更多勺子，
冰淇淋满满的♪

01:06.404 --> 01:08.439
♪ Or I'll banana split right
out that door ♪
♪ 或者我就吃香蕉船吧
走出那扇门♪

01:08.508 --> 01:11.991
♪ Don't you know,
I'm doing the Goober Rag! ♪
♪ 你不知道吗，
我正在做古伯抹布！ ♪

01:12.059 --> 01:14.853
[screams and cheers]
[尖叫声和欢呼声]

01:14.922 --> 01:16.956
I love you, Rock T. Puss!
我爱你，Rock T. Puss！

01:17.025 --> 01:19.646
♪ Oh, five and six and seven
and eight ♪
♪ 哦，五、六、七
和八个♪

01:19.715 --> 01:21.173
♪ Finish my ice cream,
licking my plate ♪
♪ 吃完我的冰淇淋，
舔我的盘子♪

01:21.197 --> 01:23.404
♪ Another fudge sundae
sure sounds great ♪
♪ 另一个软糖圣代
听起来确实很棒♪

01:23.473 --> 01:27.370
♪ And that is how I do
that Goober Rag! ♪
♪ 我就是这么做的
那个古伯拉格！ ♪

01:27.439 --> 01:29.473
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

01:29.542 --> 01:31.404
♪ Nine and ten
and eleven and twelve ♪
♪ 九点和十点
还有十一和十二♪

01:31.473 --> 01:33.335
♪ Get the Rum Raisin
off that shelf ♪
♪ 获取朗姆酒葡萄干
现货 ♪

01:33.404 --> 01:35.335
♪ I'll eat the whole tub
all on my own ♪
♪ 我要把整个浴缸都吃掉
一切都靠我自己♪

01:35.404 --> 01:37.370
♪ And I don't even need
a cone ♪
♪ 我什至不需要
一个圆锥体♪

01:37.439 --> 01:39.266
♪ Don't you know, that's how ♪
♪ 你难道不知道吗 ♪

01:39.335 --> 01:41.197
♪ Can't you see,
I'm doing it now ♪
♪ 你难道看不出来吗，
我现在就在做♪

01:41.266 --> 01:45.715
♪ I'm coming, I'm going,
I'm doing the Goober Rag! ♪
♪ 我来了，我走了
我正在做古伯抹布！ ♪

01:45.784 --> 01:49.335
[cheering]
[欢呼]

01:52.128 --> 01:54.439
All right, boys, time to go.
好了，孩子们，该出发了。

01:54.508 --> 01:56.025
You can't kick us out.
你不能把我们赶出去。

01:56.094 --> 01:59.266
We've been coming here
since we were kids.
我们一直来这里
从我们小时候起。

01:59.335 --> 02:02.025
Yeah, we're the
Goofy Scoopers' biggest fans.
是的，我们是
Goofy Scoopers 的最大粉丝。

02:02.094 --> 02:03.266
Well, that's your problem.
好吧，那是你的问题。

02:03.335 --> 02:04.818
Closing time.
关门时间。

02:04.887 --> 02:05.922
[both crying]
[两人都哭了]

02:05.991 --> 02:07.001
You don't have to go home,
你不必回家，

02:07.025 --> 02:09.370
but you can't stay here.
但你不能留在这里。

02:09.439 --> 02:11.749
- Whoa!
- Whoa!
- 哇！
- 哇！

02:11.818 --> 02:13.370
This stinks.
这很臭。

02:13.439 --> 02:16.335
I wanted to go backstage
for an autograph.
我想去后台
索要签名。

02:18.473 --> 02:19.956
Don't worry, Patrick.
别担心，帕特里克。

02:20.025 --> 02:22.991
We'll just come back and see
the Goofy Scoopers tomorrow.
我们会回来看看
明天的高飞独家新闻。

02:24.301 --> 02:26.611
[rooster crows]
[公鸡打鸣]

02:26.680 --> 02:28.128
[sighs]
[叹气]

02:28.197 --> 02:29.059
- Good morning.
- [screams]
- 早上好。
- [尖叫]

02:29.128 --> 02:31.370
I don't carry cash!
我没带现金！

02:31.439 --> 02:33.922
Huh? It's you two.
啊？是你们两个。

02:33.991 --> 02:37.301
We camped out all night
to see the Gooey Sneakers.
我们整晚都在外面露营
去看Gooey运动鞋。

02:37.370 --> 02:38.370
Goofy Scoopers.
高飞勺子。

02:38.439 --> 02:39.715
Yeah, them!
是的，他们！

02:39.784 --> 02:41.749
They're gonna write on my head.
他们会写在我头上。

02:41.818 --> 02:42.853
Well...
出色地...

02:42.922 --> 02:44.335
about that.
关于那个。

02:44.404 --> 02:46.335
<i>[mischievous music]</i>
<i>[恶作剧音乐]</i>

02:46.404 --> 02:48.025
Ee... yup.
呃...是的。

02:48.094 --> 02:49.818
The Goofy Scoopers are over.
高飞独家新闻结束了。

02:49.887 --> 02:53.749
Too old fashioned.
The kids want a new sound.
太老套了。
孩子们想要新的声音。

02:53.818 --> 02:55.646
both: A new sound?
两人：新声音？

02:55.715 --> 02:59.922
That's right, I brought in an
act you're going to flip over.
没错，我带了一个
表演你要翻身的动作。

02:59.991 --> 03:01.163
Say hello to...
向...问好

03:01.232 --> 03:03.301
DJ 2 Sc00pz!
DJ 2 Sc00pz！
DJ 2 Sc00pz！
DJ 2 Sc00pz！

03:03.370 --> 03:06.301
<i>[electronic music]</i>
<i>[电子音乐]</i>

03:06.370 --> 03:08.784
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:08.853 --> 03:10.749
Sorry, but the Goofy Scoopers
抱歉，高飞勺子

03:10.818 --> 03:13.266
are the only ice cream themed
musical robot act
是唯一的冰淇淋主题
音乐机器人表演

03:13.335 --> 03:14.542
we'll ever love.
我们会永远相爱。

03:14.611 --> 03:17.611
[rhythmic grunting]
[有节奏的咕噜声]

03:17.680 --> 03:19.370
Patrick, don't give in
帕特里克，别屈服

03:19.439 --> 03:21.991
to its seductive
womp-womps and wub-wubs.
以其诱人的
womp-womps 和 wub-wubs。

03:22.059 --> 03:23.335
Please, Mr. Manager,
经理先生，请

03:23.404 --> 03:25.439
you have to tell us
where the Scoopers are.
你必须告诉我们
独家新闻在哪里。

03:25.508 --> 03:27.473
Are they playing
at a coffee house?
他们在玩吗
在咖啡馆？

03:27.542 --> 03:29.508
Are they playing
the Bikini Bottom Bowl?
他们在玩吗
比基尼底碗？

03:29.577 --> 03:32.439
Or on a world tour?
还是去世界巡演？

03:32.508 --> 03:34.404
Oh, my, no.
哦，天哪，不。

03:34.473 --> 03:36.887
I threw those old robots
in the garbage.
我把那些旧机器人扔了
在垃圾中。

03:36.956 --> 03:40.370
They're never playing anywhere again.
他们再也不会去任何地方玩了。

03:41.473 --> 03:44.577
[both crying]
[两人都哭了]

03:47.818 --> 03:50.611
All right, you're killing
the atmosphere in here.
好吧，你这是在杀人
这里的气氛。

03:50.680 --> 03:52.887
Please do all your crying outside.
请在外面哭泣。

03:53.646 --> 03:56.163
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:56.232 --> 03:57.370
Wait a minute, Patrick.
等一下，帕特里克。

03:57.439 --> 03:58.508
I have a plan.
我有一个计划。

03:58.577 --> 04:00.197
We can stop crying.
我们可以停止哭泣。

04:00.266 --> 04:01.991
Well, I wasn't crying.
还好我没有哭。

04:02.059 --> 04:03.128
I was just...
我当时只是...

04:03.197 --> 04:06.991
flushing my eyes.
红了我的眼睛。

04:07.887 --> 04:09.335
You were saying?
你说的是？

04:09.404 --> 04:11.991
We are gonna get the
Goofy Scoopers back together
我们将会得到
高飞勺子又聚在一起了

04:12.059 --> 04:13.404
for a reunion show.
为了重聚表演。

04:13.473 --> 04:16.059
Then everyone will remember
how great they were.
那么大家都会记住
他们多么伟大啊。

04:16.128 --> 04:18.128
But we don't know
where they are.
但我们不知道
他们在哪里。

04:18.197 --> 04:21.956
True, but we do know
how they got to where they were
确实如此，但我们确实知道
他们是如何到达目的地的

04:22.025 --> 04:25.059
before they went
wherever they are.
在他们走之前
无论他们在哪里。

04:25.128 --> 04:27.887
Hmm? Hmm? Ah.
唔？唔？啊。

04:27.956 --> 04:32.163
I'm confused, but I
appreciate your confidence.
我很困惑，但我
感谢您的信心。

04:32.232 --> 04:34.853
Count me in!
算我一个吧！

04:34.922 --> 04:35.922
Ow.
噢。

04:36.853 --> 04:39.059
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

04:39.128 --> 04:41.853
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

04:41.922 --> 04:43.301
Huh.
呵呵。

04:43.370 --> 04:44.370
[engine rumbles]
[发动机隆隆声]

04:44.439 --> 04:45.956
[tires squealing]
Huh?
[轮胎吱吱声]
啊？

04:46.025 --> 04:47.956
Sorry about borrowing
your truck!
借钱的事抱歉
你的卡车！

04:48.025 --> 04:49.553
We have to save some robots
from the trash
我们必须拯救一些机器人
从垃圾中

04:49.577 --> 04:51.035
so our favorite band
can get back together.
所以我们最喜欢的乐队
可以复合。

04:51.059 --> 04:53.439
I'm sure you understand.
我相信你明白。

04:54.439 --> 04:56.094
Eh, that sounds reasonable.
呃，听起来很有道理。

04:56.163 --> 04:59.059
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

04:59.128 --> 05:01.266
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

05:01.335 --> 05:04.922
Hey, what you boys doing
to my precious junk?
嘿，你们这些家伙在做什么
我珍贵的垃圾？

05:04.991 --> 05:06.197
Sorry, sir.
对不起，先生。

05:06.266 --> 05:08.301
I was just looking
for some robot musicians.
我只是在寻找
对于一些机器人音乐家来说。

05:08.370 --> 05:10.473
And I was looking for food.
我正在寻找食物。

05:10.542 --> 05:12.784
You gonna eat this hot dog?
你要吃这个热狗吗？

05:14.128 --> 05:16.922
Well, I don't know nothing
about music-men,
嗯，我什么都不知道
关于音乐人，

05:16.991 --> 05:21.059
but I do remember one robot
fella coming through here.
但我记得有一个机器人
有个人经过这里

05:21.128 --> 05:22.404
Nice guy.
好人。

05:22.473 --> 05:24.577
Sold him to the circus
for about $3.50.
把他卖给了马戏团
约 3.50 美元。

05:24.646 --> 05:26.473
Patrick, it's our first clue.
帕特里克，这是我们的第一个线索。

05:26.542 --> 05:28.025
We gotta get to the circus.
我们得去马戏团。

05:28.094 --> 05:30.473
Great, 'cause I just found
the mayo.
太好了，因为我刚刚发现
蛋黄酱。

05:31.404 --> 05:32.818
[gulps]
[吞咽]

05:35.059 --> 05:39.025
Hey, what are you doing
in my precious junkyard?
嘿，你在做什么
在我珍贵的垃圾场里？

05:39.094 --> 05:41.577
<i>[lively music]</i>
<i>[活泼的音乐]</i>

05:41.646 --> 05:43.232
Patrick, it's Clem Clam.
帕特里克，我是克莱姆·克莱姆。

05:43.301 --> 05:44.646
Let's get him.
我们来抓住他吧。

05:44.715 --> 05:46.266
W-w-wait, Patrick.
等等，帕特里克。

05:46.335 --> 05:48.646
We're here to make friends
with him, don't you remember?
我们来这里是为了交朋友
和他在一起，你不记得了吗？

05:48.715 --> 05:50.956
Obviously, I do not.
显然，我不这么认为。

05:51.025 --> 05:54.197
How are we gonna get him
to play the show?
我们怎样才能得到他
来表演？

05:54.266 --> 05:55.370
I got it!
我得到了它！

05:55.439 --> 05:56.680
We'll appeal to his intellect
我们将诉诸他的智慧

05:56.749 --> 05:59.163
with sound reasoning
and convincing arguments.
有合理的推理
和令人信服的论据。

05:59.232 --> 06:00.922
Please!
- We need you.
请！
- 我们需要你。

06:00.991 --> 06:03.749
You gotta come back,
you just gotta.
你一定要回来，
你只需要。

06:03.818 --> 06:05.646
You can cool it, cats.
你可以冷静下来，猫们。

06:05.715 --> 06:07.818
Whatever your scheme is, I'm in.
不管你的计划是什么，我都参与。

06:07.887 --> 06:10.473
Just get me out of this
crazy circus.
让我摆脱这一切
疯狂的马戏团。

06:10.542 --> 06:12.577
I'm terrified of clowns, man.
我害怕小丑，伙计。

06:12.646 --> 06:13.646
[honking]
[鸣喇叭]

06:13.680 --> 06:15.577
[laughs]
[笑]

06:15.646 --> 06:16.818
[shudders]
[颤抖]

06:16.887 --> 06:18.646
Well, that's great,
Mr. Clem Clam,
嗯，那太好了，
克莱姆·克拉姆先生，

06:18.715 --> 06:21.853
because tomorrow night, we're
getting the band back together.
因为明天晚上，我们
让乐队重聚。

06:21.922 --> 06:24.749
Reunion show tomorrow night
at Goofy Goober's.
Reunion show tomorrow night
在高飞古伯家。

06:24.818 --> 06:26.715
So far, you're the only one
we've found, though.
到目前为止，你是唯一的一个
不过我们已经发现了。

06:26.784 --> 06:30.059
You know, the circus's
least flexible contortionist
你知道，马戏团的
最不灵活的柔术演员

06:30.128 --> 06:34.473
saw Bongos Bear at that massage
place downtown, man.
在那次按摩中看到邦戈斯熊
地点在市中心，伙计。

06:34.542 --> 06:36.853
It's true... ow...
确实是这样……呜呜……

06:36.922 --> 06:38.542
Great, come on, Patrick.
太好了，来吧，帕特里克。

06:38.611 --> 06:40.611
I feel another plan forming.
我感觉另一个计划正在形成。

06:40.680 --> 06:43.611
- [laughs]
- Wait, take me with you, man.
- [笑]
- 等等，带我一起去吧，伙计。

06:43.680 --> 06:45.404
Ahh!
- [snickers]
啊！
- [窃笑]

06:45.473 --> 06:46.715
Ugh.
啊。

06:46.784 --> 06:50.059
<i>[relaxing music]</i>
<i>[轻松的音乐]</i>

06:50.128 --> 06:53.197
Uh, yes, my wife and I are
here for the couples massage.
呃，是的，我和我的妻子
这里是情侣按摩。

06:53.266 --> 06:55.059
- [giggles]
- Say...
- [咯咯笑]
- 说...

06:55.128 --> 06:58.508
aren't you Bongos Bear
from the Goofy Scoopers?
你不是邦戈熊吗
来自高飞勺子？

06:58.577 --> 07:01.439
Son, you got the wrong
robot bear.
儿子，你错了
机器熊。

07:01.508 --> 07:03.301
I don't even like music.
我什至不喜欢音乐。

07:03.370 --> 07:05.577
I just give massages.
我只是做按摩。

07:05.646 --> 07:08.335
Don't forget to work my glutes.
别忘了锻炼我的臀肌。

07:08.404 --> 07:09.611
[shudders]
[颤抖]

07:11.439 --> 07:14.784
[rhythmic grunts]
[有节奏的咕噜声]

07:18.853 --> 07:23.163
[bongo sounds]
[邦戈声音]

07:23.232 --> 07:25.370
All right, all right, you win.
好吧好吧，你赢了。

07:25.439 --> 07:27.128
I am Bongos Bear.
我是邦戈斯熊。

07:27.197 --> 07:30.301
And I got music in my cold,
robotic heart.
我在寒冷中听音乐，
机器人心脏。

07:30.370 --> 07:31.646
both: Yay!
两人：耶！

07:31.715 --> 07:33.611
Well, you're in luck,
'cause Patrick and I
嗯，你很幸运，
因为帕特里克和我

07:33.680 --> 07:35.784
are getting your band
back together.
正在得到你的乐队
回到一起。

07:35.853 --> 07:38.680
Yeah, but we still gotta find
the piano octopus.
是的，但我们还得找到
钢琴章鱼。

07:38.749 --> 07:40.163
Oh, that's easy.
哦，这很容易。

07:40.232 --> 07:42.853
A construction worker
with lumbago told me
一名建筑工人
腰痛告诉我

07:42.922 --> 07:46.094
Rock is working on the bridge
to Shell City now.
岩石正在桥上工作
现在去贝壳城。

07:46.163 --> 07:49.439
It's true... ow...
确实是这样……呜呜……

07:49.508 --> 07:51.163
- Rock?
- Rock T. Puss?
- 岩石？
- 摇滚 T. 猫？

07:51.232 --> 07:55.749
[panicked screams]
[惊慌的尖叫声]

07:55.818 --> 07:57.059
This stinks.
这很臭。

07:57.128 --> 08:00.991
Bongos lied.
I don't see him anywhere.
邦戈斯撒谎了。
我在任何地方都没有看到他。

08:01.059 --> 08:02.646
- Hey!
- Get out of here.
- 嘿！
- 离开这里。

08:02.715 --> 08:04.128
I'm on the job.
我正在工作。

08:04.197 --> 08:05.542
Rock T. Puss,
摇滚 T. 猫，

08:05.611 --> 08:08.404
we're SpongeBob and Patrick;
we're your biggest fans.
我们是海绵宝宝和帕特里克；
我们是你最大的粉丝。

08:08.473 --> 08:09.853
Yeah, right.
是的，对。

08:09.922 --> 08:11.439
No one remembers my music.
没有人记得我的音乐。

08:11.508 --> 08:12.646
That's okay.
没关系。

08:12.715 --> 08:14.991
I don't remember anything.
我什么都不记得了。

08:17.646 --> 08:20.094
Look, kids,
I'm a working robot now.
看，孩子们，
我现在是一个工作机器人。

08:20.163 --> 08:23.508
The only bands I care about
are the boats on this bridge.
我唯一关心的乐队
是这座桥上的船。

08:23.577 --> 08:25.197
Their honking horns
他们的喇叭

08:25.266 --> 08:27.680
are the only applause
I'll ever need again.
是唯一的掌声
我会再次需要。

08:27.749 --> 08:29.715
[horn blares]
[喇叭声]

08:29.784 --> 08:31.784
- Um...
- Oh, that was me.
- 嗯...
- 哦，那是我。

08:31.853 --> 08:34.266
Sorry, I blame the hot dog.
抱歉，我责怪热狗。

08:34.335 --> 08:35.853
Oh, please, Mr. Puss.
哦，拜托，猫先生。

08:35.922 --> 08:37.722
We're getting the Goofy
Scoopers back together
我们遇到了高飞
舀回一起

08:37.749 --> 08:38.784
for a reunion show.
为了重聚表演。

08:38.853 --> 08:40.232
We need you.
我们需要你。

08:40.301 --> 08:41.715
The answer is no.
答案是否定的。

08:41.784 --> 08:44.059
I'm a bridge now.
Get out of here.
我现在是一座桥梁。
离开这里。

08:44.128 --> 08:47.232
- [sighs]
- [whimpers]
- [叹气]
- [呜咽]

08:47.301 --> 08:49.059
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

08:49.128 --> 08:50.335
Hey, guys.
嘿，伙计们。

08:50.404 --> 08:51.473
Where's Rock?
洛克在哪里？

08:51.542 --> 08:52.680
Oh, he's not coming.
哦，他不来了。

08:52.749 --> 08:54.232
Wha?
世界卫生大会？

08:54.301 --> 08:57.266
I don't know if we can do this
without Rock T. Puss.
我不知道我们是否可以做到这一点
没有Rock T. Puss。

08:57.335 --> 08:59.680
Don't worry,
we'll be playing with you.
别担心，
我们会和你一起玩。

08:59.749 --> 09:01.059
It'll be fun.
会很有趣的。

09:01.128 --> 09:02.991
Here's the new piece I wrote.
这是我写的新作品。

09:03.059 --> 09:04.749
We're gonna come in hot
off the intro,
我们会热情地进来
关掉介绍，

09:04.818 --> 09:07.059
so try to keep up.
所以尽量跟上。

09:07.128 --> 09:08.680
Huh.
呵呵。

09:08.749 --> 09:10.818
[guitar feedback]
[吉他反馈]

09:10.887 --> 09:11.922
[heavy rock music]
[重摇滚]

09:11.991 --> 09:13.025
♪ Ice cream, so tasty ♪
♪ 冰淇淋，太好吃了 ♪

09:13.094 --> 09:14.094
♪ Freezing in my mouth ♪
♪ 在我嘴里冻结 ♪

09:14.128 --> 09:15.139
♪ Icy pain inside my brain ♪
♪ 我的大脑冰冷的疼痛 ♪

09:15.163 --> 09:16.542
♪ Won't you help me out? ♪
♪ 你不帮我吗？ ♪

09:16.611 --> 09:18.715
♪ I have a brain freeze,
I have a brain freeze ♪
♪ 我的大脑冻结了，
我脑子有病了♪

09:18.784 --> 09:21.370
♪ I have a brain freeze,
help me with my brain freeze ♪
♪ 我的大脑冻结了，
帮助我冻结我的大脑♪

09:21.439 --> 09:23.577
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:23.646 --> 09:25.542
Can I have another sundae, please?
我可以再来一份圣代吗？

09:25.611 --> 09:29.197
[crowd booing]
[人群嘘声]

09:29.266 --> 09:31.473
They are not digging it, man.
他们没有挖它，伙计。

09:31.542 --> 09:33.404
We told you guys to keep up.
我们告诉你们要跟上。

09:33.473 --> 09:36.853
<i>[mysterious tones]</i>
<i>[神秘的音调]</i>

09:36.922 --> 09:39.991
<i>[triumphant music]</i>
<i>[胜利的音乐]</i>

09:40.646 --> 09:41.853
[laughs]
[笑]

09:41.922 --> 09:44.887
Rock T. Puss, you came.
洛克·T·普斯，你来了。

09:44.956 --> 09:46.646
Sorry I left you hanging, guys.
抱歉，我让你们悬着了，伙计们。

09:46.715 --> 09:48.473
I did like being a bridge.
我确实喜欢成为一座桥梁。

09:48.542 --> 09:50.922
But I was built to make music.
但我生来就是为了创作音乐的。

09:50.991 --> 09:52.646
Say, how is the bridge?
话说，桥怎么样了？

09:52.715 --> 09:54.232
Eh, I'm sure its fine.
嗯，我确定没问题。

09:54.301 --> 09:55.232
<i>[comical tones]</i>
<i>[滑稽的语气]</i>

09:55.301 --> 09:58.025
[panicked screams]
[惊慌的尖叫声]

09:59.370 --> 10:00.749
Now, let's rock.
现在，让我们摇滚吧。

10:00.818 --> 10:03.749
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

10:03.818 --> 10:09.646
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

10:09.715 --> 10:11.956
[crowd booing]
[人群嘘声]

10:12.025 --> 10:15.232
The kids still don't like it.
What do we do?
孩子们还是不喜欢。
我们该怎么办？

10:15.301 --> 10:16.197
Huh?
啊？

10:16.266 --> 10:18.404
Maybe I can help with that.
也许我可以帮忙。

10:18.473 --> 10:20.128
I'm DJ 2 Sc00pz,
我是 DJ 2 Sc00pz，

10:20.197 --> 10:22.818
and I'm a huge
Goofy Scoopers fan.
我是一个巨大的
高飞独家粉丝。

10:22.887 --> 10:24.232
Care to jam?
介意堵塞吗？

10:24.301 --> 10:27.232
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

10:27.301 --> 10:34.163
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

10:50.887 --> 10:55.025
both: Best
Goofy Scoopers show ever!
两者：最好
高飞独家表演！

两者：最好
高飞独家表演！